    },
    {
      "key": "4b3e57a4-ecea-4b58-b143-ec26a700f306",
      "position": 3,
      "properties": {
        "description": "<i class=\"fa fa-comments\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> **Discuss:** Click the animated slide to display the discussion prompts.\n- *What was awesome about writing your code?*\n- *What is one action you can take to improve your code?*\n- *What questions do you have about today?*\n\n<i class=\"fa fa-lightbulb-o\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> **Discussion Goal:**  : Students reflect on how they used randint() to create random effects in their Theater scene. Listen for students to describe what they randomized, how their number ranges affected the result, and what they would revise to make the scene feel more intentional.",
        "tips": [
          {
            "type": "teachingTip",
            "markdown": "Glows, Grows, Want-to-Knows helps students celebrate progress, name a next step, and surface questions or misconceptions before moving on."
          }
        ]
      },
      "seeding_key": {
        "activity_section.key": "4b3e57a4-ecea-4b58-b143-ec26a700f306",
        "lesson_activity.key": "6f8f585f-6855-45b5-8171-9ef95f4d9383"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "1951e72d-ab21-4973-ae9a-3e4c8d5273a9",
      "position": 1,
      "properties": {
        "duration": "5",
        "name": "Warm Up"
      },
      "seeding_key": {
        "activity_section.key": "1951e72d-ab21-4973-ae9a-3e4c8d5273a9",
        "lesson_activity.key": "0256a66f-744c-45f1-a740-58b63914fdc9"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "d910a94c-87fb-4206-8ca9-aaef96ebc94d",
      "position": 2,
      "properties": {
        "description": "<i class=\"fa-solid fa-bullseye-arrow\"></i> **Goal of this activity:** Students connect the cultural \"wrapped\"-style recap format they already recognize to the idea that good personalization comes from specific, meaningful details, not just a name slapped on a template — setting up the \"who is it for, and why\" question they'll answer in Level 1.\n\n<i class=\"fa fa-comments\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> **Discuss:** Click the animated slide to display the discussion prompts.\n- *What's an example of a \"wrapped\"-style recap you've seen?*\n- *What made it feel personal instead of generic, not just labeled with a name?*\n\n<i class=\"fa fa-lightbulb-o\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> **Discussion Goal:** Students name a specific personalization detail —not a generic \"it had my name on it\" — that connects to the \"who is it for, and why\" question they'll answer in Level 1's Topic step."
      },
      "seeding_key": {
        "activity_section.key": "d910a94c-87fb-4206-8ca9-aaef96ebc94d",
        "lesson_activity.key": "0256a66f-744c-45f1-a740-58b63914fdc9"
      }
    },
